        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Milaneseria, you'll have to manage your own Milanese restaurant. Your mission is super simple: cook the coolest Milanese in the neighborhood, make sure you always have stock, and leave your customers more than satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the coolest Milanese maker in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing to find a job for months, you come across 100,000 pesos in the street and decide to open a Milanesa restaurant, but not everything would be as simple as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARCADE MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Milaneseria's arcade mode, you'll manage your Milanese restaurant, satisfying your customers to ensure another day in business.</p>",
